\chapter{Verification and Architectural Security}

\section{Barrelfish Partitioning}

At the macro scale, hardware is split into independent microkernel nodes
following the Barrelfish multikernel architecture \footcite{baum09}.

\section{Framekernel TCB}
Within each node, shared memory and memory safety are maintained using
an Asterinas-style Framekernel written in Rust \footcite{peng24},
isolating hardware drivers and memory operations inside explicit safety
domains.

